+## 13. Admin Diagnostics & Realtime Probes Studio
+The Admin Diagnostics Studio (`/admin/diagnostics`) monitors subsystem health, executes active telemetry probes, and tracks container resource limits.
+
+![Admin Diagnostics Studio - Desktop Light](images/slice4-diagnostics-1440x900-light.png)
+
+
+### Admin Diagnostics Studio Configuration Table
+
+| Field Name | What It Controls | Allowed Values / Format | Default | Security / Operational Impact |
+| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
+| `postgresql_rls` | PostgreSQL connectivity, pool saturation, migrations, RLS | 82 migrations, 100 tables `FORCE RLS` | Continuous | Core persistence and tenant isolation; latency threshold < 15ms |
+| `realtime_hub_outbox` | Transactional outbox relay and dispatch loop | Backlog depth, lag seconds, listener status | Continuous | Event delivery to WebSocket subscribers; lag threshold < 5s |
+| `job_worker_pool` | Background asynchronous task execution engine | Active tasks, worker concurrency, DLQ depth | Continuous | Processes asynchronous jobs; dead-letter queue must equal 0 |
+| `wasm_script_sandbox` | Wasmtime AST compiler and script sandbox execution | Compiler state, memory limits, fuel budget | Continuous | Sandboxed custom fields; fuel caps prevent infinite execution loops |
+| `agent_runtime_providers`| Health and latency of active AI model providers | `openai`, `gemini`, `ollama` provider status | Continuous | Informs sparkle completions and AI gates; reports monthly budget |
+| `remote_runner_fleet` | Connected mTLS build runner nodes over port :8444 | Online runner count, heartbeat timestamp | Continuous | Distributed workload execution; heartbeats must arrive within 30s |
+| `rate_limiter` | In-memory token bucket and IP throttle health | Bucket capacity, blocked IP count, error rate | Continuous | Protects API endpoints from volumetric denial-of-service |
+| `realtime_pubsub_probe` | Active PostgreSQL LISTEN/NOTIFY latency measurement | Latency milliseconds (target < 1.0ms) | On Demand | Validates database pub/sub bus responsiveness |
+| `websocket_ws_probe` | Real WebSocket ping/pong frame roundtrip measurement | Latency milliseconds (target < 50ms) | On Demand | Validates client-to-server WebSocket bidirectional messaging |
+
+![Admin Diagnostics Realtime Probe Active](images/slice4-diagnostics-realtime-probe-active.png)
+
+### Setting-by-Setting Technical Paragraphs
+
+- **`postgresql_rls`:** Evaluates database health via `GET /api/v1/admin/diagnostics`. Asserts that the single-head Alembic migration tree is fully applied (82/82 migrations), connection pool saturation remains under 75%, and all 100 application tables enforce `FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY`. Connection latency is sampled continuously with healthy thresholds < 15ms.
+- **`realtime_hub_outbox`:** Tracks the transactional outbox relay daemon (`database/outbox/relay.py`). Measures the unprocessed message queue depth, average dispatch lag (healthy < 5s), and PostgreSQL `LISTEN/NOTIFY` channel subscription status. Stalled outboxes trigger immediate administrative alerts.
+- **`job_worker_pool`:** Monitors asynchronous background task executors responsible for webhook dispatch, automated snapshot creation, and audit logging. Reports total active tasks, concurrency utilization, and dead-letter queue (DLQ) depth. Any non-zero DLQ count indicates unhandled job failures requiring inspection.
+- **`wasm_script_sandbox`:** Monitors the in-process Wasmtime runtime executing custom field formulas and transition helpers. Verifies compiler initialization, memory consumption caps (default 32 MiB / 33,554,432 bytes per instance), and fuel budget limits preventing CPU exhaustion.
+- **`agent_runtime_providers`:** Asserts the availability and response latency of registered AI model providers (`gemini`, `openai`, `ollama`). Reports monthly token consumption against configured budget ceilings, warning administrators before cloud budget caps halt automated transition gates.
+- **`remote_runner_fleet`:** Tracks external execution nodes connected via mutual TLS (mTLS) over dedicated port `:8444`. Reports active runner counts, certificate expiration dates, and heartbeat timestamps. Runners failing to report within 30 seconds are marked offline and their active leases rescheduled.
+- **`rate_limiter`:** Reports the runtime state of in-memory token bucket rate limiters across public and authenticated routes. Tracks blocked request volumes and active IP throttle mappings, ensuring system resilience against abusive traffic.
+- **`realtime_pubsub_probe` and `websocket_ws_probe`:** On-demand latency probes. The pub/sub probe (`POST /api/v1/admin/diagnostics/probes/realtime`) injects a synthetic outbox notification and captures `LISTEN/NOTIFY` roundtrip time (typically ~0.38ms). The WebSocket probe initiates a live `/ws` binary ping frame in the operator's browser, measuring connection setup (~13.7ms) and ping/pong roundtrip latency (~0.44ms).
+
